<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCHMAN LANG TO JOIN SPORTING NEXT SEASON.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCHMAN LANG TO JOIN SPORTING NEXT SEASON.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French midfielder Didier Lang has agreed to leave France's Metz to join Portuguese first division side Sporting at the end of the season, club sources said.</p>
<p>Lang, 26, will join the Lisbon side for three seasons. He was spotted by Sporting officials during their UEFA Cup clash against Metz last year.</p>
